   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello, <div><br></div><div>I had a question about running NBLAST against the database of FlyCircuit neurons.<br><div><br></div><div>I use the following few lines of code to try and run NBLAST with a query against the FlyCircuit database:</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">devtools</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">source_gist</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;bbaf5d53353b3944c090&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> filename</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;FlyCircuitStartupNat.R&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># This creates a neuronlistfh called dps </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>nblast</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">query</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> target </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dps</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></font><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br></div><div>However, this produces the following error which terminates the execution of the code above</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><font color=\"#660066\"><div>trying URL &#39;<a href=\"http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/data/e92f2755df1f3c9d8b2622fdec8750b2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/data/e92f2755df1f3c9d8b2622fdec8750b2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760341000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3acYFLW41IMlb8o2yBII35\">http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/data/e92f2755df1f3c9d8b2622fdec8750b2</a>&#39;</div><div><br><div>InternetOpenUrl failed: &#39;The operation timed out&#39;Error in download.file(url = paste0(attr(fh, &quot;remote&quot;), missing[i]), destfile = file.path(objDir,  : </div><div>  cannot open URL &#39;<a href=\"http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/data/e1faaf997392e25dbd05dc7ec89bbf27\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/data/e1faaf997392e25dbd05dc7ec89bbf27&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760341000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1iQ96LkNlecZ3giBQfJwLp\">http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/data/e1faaf997392e25dbd05dc7ec89bbf27</a>&#39;</div></div><div><br></div></font></div></code></div><br></div></div><div>I use as reference the following pages: <a href=\"https://gist.github.com/jefferis/bbaf5d53353b3944c090\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/jefferis/bbaf5d53353b3944c090&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760341000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1AibWbsdUv3RdZ7AefjM1P\">https://gist.github.com/jefferis/bbaf5d53353b3944c090</a>, <a href=\"http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/www/nblast_desktop/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/www/nblast_desktop/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760341000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1iDU6R5drMSE-hvfhObs8b\">http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/www/nblast_desktop/</a>, <a href=\"http://jefferislab.github.io/nat.nblast/reference/nblast.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://jefferislab.github.io/nat.nblast/reference/nblast.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760341000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2LPMYWFYliPkzRWktLTuwb\">http://jefferislab.github.io/nat.nblast/reference/nblast.html</a></div><div><br></div><div>However, since these references only use the kcs20 dataset as an example, I was wondering if I&#39;m missing something in how to use the FlyCircuit database as my target instead?</div><div><br></div><div>Many thanks, </div><div>Shruthi</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
