     "<div dir=\"auto\"><div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div>However, this produces the following error which terminates the execution of the code above</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><font color=\"#660066\"><div>trying URL &#39;<a href=\"http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/data/e92f2755df1f3c9d8b2622fdec8750b2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/data/e92f2755df1f3c9d8b2622fdec8750b2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760344000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3MOeymsrX6cSOgMyeMuJPo\">http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/data/e92f2755df1f3c9d8b2622fdec8750b2</a>&#39;</div><div><br><div>InternetOpenUrl failed: &#39;The operation timed out&#39;Error in download.file(url = paste0(attr(fh, &quot;remote&quot;), missing[i]), destfile = file.path(objDir,  : </div><div>  cannot open URL &#39;<a href=\"http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/data/e1faaf997392e25dbd05dc7ec89bbf27\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/data/e1faaf997392e25dbd05dc7ec89bbf27&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760344000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1X84Ro643rtDdfTooAet19\">http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/data/e1faaf997392e25dbd05dc7ec89bbf27</a>&#39;</div></div><div><br></div></font></div></code></div><br></div></div></div></div></blockquote><div><br></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"auto\"><div><div>The gist page (listed below) suggests doing this the first time you download these data:</div><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;word-wrap:normal;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;line-height:1.45;overflow:auto;padding:16px;word-break:normal\"><font face=\"UICTFontTextStyleBody\"><span style=\"white-space:normal;background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">dps</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&lt;-</span>read.neuronlistfh(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span><a href=\"http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/dpscanon.rds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/dpscanon.rds&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760344000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2fDyD8YhYb_TpknhAL30sQ\">http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/dpscanon.rds</a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>,\r\n    <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">localdir</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">=</span>getOption(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span>flycircuit.datadir<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span></span>))\r\nremotesync(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">dps</span>,<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">download.missing</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">TRUE</span>)</span></font><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody;white-space:normal;background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0)\"> </span></pre></div>Did you try that yet?<div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div><br></div><div>Greg. </div><div><br></div><div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div></div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
    ],
