     "<div dir=\"auto\"><div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I use as reference the following pages: <a href=\"https://gist.github.com/jefferis/bbaf5d53353b3944c090\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/jefferis/bbaf5d53353b3944c090&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760344000&amp;usg=AOvVaw28np7Y8pLAoLkFwHpzksrt\">https://gist.github.com/jefferis/bbaf5d53353b3944c090</a>, <a href=\"http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/www/nblast_desktop/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/www/nblast_desktop/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760344000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3wXwCvVW8_e0q80F72vcOk\">http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/www/nblast_desktop/</a>, <a href=\"http://jefferislab.github.io/nat.nblast/reference/nblast.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://jefferislab.github.io/nat.nblast/reference/nblast.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760344000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2bWwCUpAumWzS5dG_tmt3Q\">http://jefferislab.github.io/nat.nblast/reference/nblast.html</a></div><div><br></div><div>However, since these references only use the kcs20 dataset as an example, I was wondering if I&#39;m missing something in how to use the FlyCircuit database as my target instead?</div><div><br></div><div>Many thanks, </div><div>Shruthi</div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
