     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"auto\"><div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><br>\r\nVisit this group at <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/group/nat-user\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/group/nat-user&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760348000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2MUsRXfX6P311ZvxUMTsyG\">https://groups.google.com/group/nat-user</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/nat-user/c57cefa7-3d05-449d-8035-1cf53d9f4dae%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/nat-user/c57cefa7-3d05-449d-8035-1cf53d9f4dae%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760348000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3WiFaO_6k-M9dz-QUgKZn0\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/nat-user/c57cefa7-3d05-449d-8035-1cf53d9f4dae%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760348000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0hGqTuvEZTU98E0p7Fn_o7\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</div></blockquote></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
