   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear Shruthi,<div><br></div><div>When you are finished, you can just run the original command:</div><div><br></div><div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.899999618530273px;margin-bottom:16px;word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(246,248,250);border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;line-height:1.45;overflow:auto;padding:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:normal\">devtools</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:normal;color:rgb(102,102,0)\">::</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:normal\">source_gist</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:normal;color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:normal;color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;bbaf5d53353b3944c090&quot;</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:normal;color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:normal\"> filename</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:normal;color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:normal;color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;FlyCircuitStartupNat.R&quot;</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:normal;color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:normal\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:normal;color:rgb(136,0,0)\"># This creates a neuronlistfh called dps </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:normal\"><br>nblast</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:normal;color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:normal\">query</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:normal;color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:normal\"> target </span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:normal;color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:normal\"> dps</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:normal;color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:normal\"><br></span><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;background-color:transparent;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;word-break:normal;display:inline;line-height:inherit;overflow:visible;word-wrap:normal\"></code></pre></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div>Or you can do:</div><div><pre style=\"margin-bottom:16px;padding:16px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.899999618530273px;word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(246,248,250);border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;line-height:1.45;overflow:auto;color:rgb(36,41,46)\">dps&lt;-read.neuronlistfh(&quot;<a href=\"http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/dpscanon.rds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/dpscanon.rds&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760356000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2owe2vJty09QeWX2X1f9x5\">http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/dpscanon.rds</a>&quot;,\tlocaldir=getOption(&#39;flycircuit.datadir&#39;))\r\nnblast(query, target = dps)<code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;background-color:transparent;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;word-break:normal;display:inline;line-height:inherit;overflow:visible;word-wrap:normal\"></code></pre><div><div></div></div></div><div>(which is basically just copying the first line from in the gist)</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div><br></div><div>Greg.</div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div><br>On Tuesday, June 18, 2019 at 10:34:17 PM UTC+1, Shruthi Ravindranath wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Thank you for your response. When I try to access the URL directly from my browser, I have no troubles and a file is downloaded. <div><br></div><div>I am now downloading the data as suggested by the gist. Are these the dps files of the FlyCircuit neurons? Once the download is complete, would it be sufficient to say the following to read in the dps and run NBLAST?<div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">flyCircuit_db </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">neurons</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;path/to/flycircuit.datadir&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>nblast</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">query</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> flyCircuit_db</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br></span></div></code></div><br>Best, </div><div>Shruthi<br><br>On Tuesday, June 18, 2019 at 5:01:06 PM UTC-4, Gregory Jefferis wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"auto\">Dear Shruthi,<br><br>What happens if you try to access that url directly in your web browser? It works ok from here. <div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div>However, this produces the following error which terminates the execution of the code above</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><font color=\"#660066\"><div>trying URL &#39;<a href=\"http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/data/e92f2755df1f3c9d8b2622fdec8750b2\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/data/e92f2755df1f3c9d8b2622fdec8750b2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760356000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0p6qslU9tJ6nOt0Y7wi2g6\">http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/data/e92f2755df1f3c9d8b2622fdec8750b2</a>&#39;</div><div><br><div>InternetOpenUrl failed: &#39;The operation timed out&#39;Error in download.file(url = paste0(attr(fh, &quot;remote&quot;), missing[i]), destfile = file.path(objDir,  : </div><div>  cannot open URL &#39;<a href=\"http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/data/e1faaf997392e25dbd05dc7ec89bbf27\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/data/e1faaf997392e25dbd05dc7ec89bbf27&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760356000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2HOqr11CHUp9KiivACBqKs\">http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/data/e1faaf997392e25dbd05dc7ec89bbf27</a>&#39;</div></div><div><br></div></font></div></code></div><br></div></div></div></div></blockquote><div><br></div><div>The gist page (listed below) suggests doing this the first time you download these data:</div><div><pre style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;word-wrap:normal;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;line-height:1.45;overflow:auto;padding:16px;word-break:normal\"><font face=\"UICTFontTextStyleBody\"><span style=\"white-space:normal;background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0)\"><span>dps</span><span>&lt;-</span>read.neuronlistfh(<span><span>&quot;</span><a href=\"http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/dpscanon.rds\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/dpscanon.rds&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760356000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2owe2vJty09QeWX2X1f9x5\">http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/flycircuit/dpscanon.rds</a><span>&quot;</span></span>,\r\n    <span>localdir</span><span>=</span>getOption(<span><span>&#39;</span>flycircuit.datadir<span>&#39;</span></span>))\r\nremotesync(<span>dps</span>,<span>download.missing</span> <span>=</span> <span>TRUE</span>)</span></font><span style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody;white-space:normal;background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0)\"> </span></pre></div>Did you try that yet?<div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div><br></div><div>Greg. </div><div><br></div><div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I use as reference the following pages: <a href=\"https://gist.github.com/jefferis/bbaf5d53353b3944c090\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/jefferis/bbaf5d53353b3944c090&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760356000&amp;usg=AOvVaw05Y9t_r1_DrP1KD0xwrrP3\">https://gist.github.com/jefferis/bbaf5d53353b3944c090</a>, <a href=\"http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/www/nblast_desktop/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/www/nblast_desktop/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760356000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1G1ag_kYkIZtaPDOaNZ9FP\">http://flybrain.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/si/nblast/www/nblast_desktop/</a>, <a href=\"http://jefferislab.github.io/nat.nblast/reference/nblast.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://jefferislab.github.io/nat.nblast/reference/nblast.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760356000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0YjUScnRj-etn3GAXeVlJj\">http://jefferislab.github.io/nat.nblast/reference/nblast.html</a></div><div><br></div><div>However, since these references only use the kcs20 dataset as an example, I was wondering if I&#39;m missing something in how to use the FlyCircuit database as my target instead?</div><div><br></div><div>Many thanks, </div><div>Shruthi</div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;nat-user&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">nat-...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nVisit this group at <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/group/nat-user\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/group/nat-user&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760356000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3PrbSkmdllRviRsM4e13dH\">https://groups.google.com/group/nat-user</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/nat-user/c57cefa7-3d05-449d-8035-1cf53d9f4dae%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/nat-user/c57cefa7-3d05-449d-8035-1cf53d9f4dae%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760356000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Y3pAZXiX8WiII3d5sbrLh\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/nat-user/c57cefa7-3d05-449d-8035-1cf53d9f4dae%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485760356000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3uM1A6XQ6YyjrXgN8HWrs-\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</div></blockquote></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
